> Em segunda-feira, 26 de setembro de 2016 21:31:11 UTC+3, aionys escreveu:
>>
>> Aha, I found .xorxes.'s proposal. Apparently it overloads {gi}, while
>> this one does not?
>>
>> https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/lojban/ExtEumbYoQg
>>
